        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-19T18:59:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hey, if he manages to have two of a given weapon out like the Crowbars or Jackhandle, does it activate twice when he does damage?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Each Dual Crowbars would trigger. However, Jack Handle wouldn't benefit from having multiple copies of it at once. Having Dual Crowbars and Jack Handle in play together would be quite good. Essentially dealing all non-hero targets damage twice, with one of the hits most likely being slightly stronger than the other.</p>",
